From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:29:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1581/3799] soh: rename func_80A90EBC -> EnKakasi3_Dance

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: turns each ocarina note into a dance move exactly as EnKakasi_Dance does, ramping up to a jump after eight notes; its argument makes it pick random notes instead, for the playback.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi3/z_en_kakasi3.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi3/z_en_kakasi3.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi3/z_en_kakasi3.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi3/z_en_kakasi3.c
index a3f60f2c3..a798e25cf 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi3/z_en_kakasi3.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Kakasi3/z_en_kakasi3.c
@@ -96,7 +96,8 @@ void EnKakasi3_ReturnToRest(EnKakasi3* this) {
     Math_SmoothStepToS(&this->actor.shape.rot.z, this->rot.z, 5, 0x2710, 0);
 }
 
-void func_80A90EBC(EnKakasi3* this, PlayState* play, s32 arg) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A90EBC: turns each ocarina note into a dance move exactly as EnKakasi_Dance does, ramping up to a jump after eight notes; its argument makes it pick random notes instead, for the playback.
+void EnKakasi3_Dance(EnKakasi3* this, PlayState* play, s32 arg) {
     s16 currentFrame;
     s16 ocarinaNote = play->msgCtx.lastOcaNoteIdx;
 
@@ -303,7 +304,7 @@ void func_80A91620(EnKakasi3* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 
     if (play->msgCtx.ocarinaMode == OCARINA_MODE_01) {
-        func_80A90EBC(this, play, 0);
+        EnKakasi3_Dance(this, play, 0);  // was func_80A90EBC [LLM:HIGH]
         player->stateFlags2 |= PLAYER_STATE2_NEAR_OCARINA_ACTOR;
     }
 }
@@ -323,7 +324,7 @@ void func_80A91760(EnKakasi3* this, PlayState* play) {
 void func_80A917FC(EnKakasi3* this, PlayState* play) {
 
     if (play->msgCtx.ocarinaMode != OCARINA_MODE_0F) {
-        func_80A90EBC(this, play, 1);
+        EnKakasi3_Dance(this, play, 1);  // was func_80A90EBC [LLM:HIGH]
     } else {
         play->msgCtx.ocarinaMode = OCARINA_MODE_04;
         Message_CloseTextbox(play);
@@ -376,7 +377,7 @@ void func_80A918E4(EnKakasi3* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 
     if (play->msgCtx.ocarinaMode == OCARINA_MODE_01) {
-        func_80A90EBC(this, play, 0);
+        EnKakasi3_Dance(this, play, 0);  // was func_80A90EBC [LLM:HIGH]
         player->stateFlags2 |= PLAYER_STATE2_NEAR_OCARINA_ACTOR;
     }
 }
